 "description": "<p>A five-piece plush bunny set in pink: headband, sleeves, top, neck ring, skirt, and belt, sized one-size for 40-60 kg. The plush finish is the differentiator - most bunny sets run satin or leather, and this one runs soft.</p>\n<p>Split construction means the top and skirt are separate, which adjusts better than a one-piece to different torso lengths. The neck ring and belt pull the silhouette together at the two points that matter.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester plush</li>\n<li>Includes: headband, sleeves, top, neck ring, skirt, belt</li>\n<li>Style: plush bunny girl</li>\n<li>Color: pink</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pink plush from ears to belt, 40-60 kg. The coziest bunny format on the site.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Pink plush bunny girl set with headband, sleeves, top, neck ring, skirt and belt, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
